## 🎨 Customization

### Change Hologram Colors

Edit the `content:` lines in your hologram config:

```yaml
- content: '&6&l⚔ YOUR CUSTOM TITLE ⚔'  # Gold & Bold
  height: 0.3
- content: '&e#1 &f%legion_top_kills_1_name% &7- &a%legion_top_kills_1_value%'
  height: 0.3
```

### Minecraft Color Codes

| Code | Color | Preview |
|------|-------|---------|
| `&0` | Black | ⬛ |
| `&1` | Dark Blue | 🔷 |
| `&2` | Dark Green | 🟢 |
| `&3` | Dark Aqua | 🔵 |
| `&4` | Dark Red | 🔴 |
| `&5` | Dark Purple | 🟣 |
| `&6` | Gold | 🟡 |
| `&7` | Gray | ⚪ |
| `&8` | Dark Gray | ⚫ |
| `&9` | Blue | 🔵 |
| `&a` | Green | 🟢 |
| `&b` | Aqua | 💠 |
| `&c` | Red | 🔴 |
| `&d` | Light Purple | 🟪 |
| `&e` | Yellow | 🟨 |
| `&f` | White | ⚪ |

### Format Codes

| Code | Effect |
|------|--------|
| `&l` | **Bold** |
| `&m` | ~~Strikethrough~~ |
| `&n` | <u>Underline</u> |
| `&o` | *Italic* |
| `&r` | Reset (remove all formatting) |

### Adjust Spacing

Change the `height:` value:
```yaml
# Large gap
- content: ''
  height: 0.5

# Normal gap
- content: ''
  height: 0.3

# Small gap
- content: ''
  height: 0.1
```

### Update Frequency

Change how often holograms refresh:
```yaml
update-interval: 20   # 1 second (20 ticks)
update-interval: 40   # 2 seconds
update-interval: 100  # 5 seconds (recommended)
update-interval: 200  # 10 seconds (less lag)
```

