## 📝 Example Uses

### Scoreboard (FeatherBoard / CMI)

```yaml
scoreboard:
  title: '&6&lLegion Arena'
  lines:
    - ''
    - '&eYour Stats:'
    - '  &7Kills: &a%legion_kills%'
    - '  &7Deaths: &c%legion_deaths%'
    - '  &7K/D: &e%legion_kdr%'
    - ''
    - '&eRanking:'
    - '  &7Round: &a%legion_highest_round%'
    - '  &7Wins: &a%legion_wins%'
    - '  &7Win Rate: &e%legion_winrate%%'
    - ''
    - '&eProgress:'
    - '  &7Gems: &6%legion_gems%'
    - '  &7Kits: &d%legion_unlocked_kits%&7/&d9'
```

### TAB Plugin Header/Footer

```yaml
header:
  - '&6&l━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━'
  - '&e&lLegion Mob Arena'
  - '&6&l━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━'
  - ''
  - '&7Your Stats: &e%legion_kills% &7kills | &c%legion_deaths% &7deaths'
  - '&7Best Round: &a%legion_highest_round% &7| Wins: &a%legion_wins%'

footer:
  - ''
  - '&7Play: &e/legion'
  - '&6&l━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━'
```

### Chat Format (EssentialsX / Vault)

```yaml
# Show highest round in chat prefix
format: '&7[&aRound %legion_highest_round%&7] &f{DISPLAYNAME}&7: {MESSAGE}'

# Show wins badge
format: '&7[&6%legion_wins% Wins&7] &f{DISPLAYNAME}&7: {MESSAGE}'
```

### Custom Scoreboard Example

```yaml
lines:
  - '&6&m━━━━━━━━━━━━━'
  - '&e&lTop Killers'
  - '&6&m━━━━━━━━━━━━━'
  - ''
  - '&e1. &f%legion_top_kills_1_name%'
  - '&7   %legion_top_kills_1_value% kills'
  - '&e2. &f%legion_top_kills_2_name%'
  - '&7   %legion_top_kills_2_value% kills'
  - '&e3. &f%legion_top_kills_3_name%'
  - '&7   %legion_top_kills_3_value% kills'
```

